{"unit_id":"ljcoder2015__dsh-canvas-flow#card-zh","repo":"ljcoder2015/dsh-canvas-flow","commit":"096943d4e872c87bac3d46ed1b9e07354393c358","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-canvas-flow 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的无限画布工作流插件。它在 DSH 界面提供画布面板，并由宿主侧注册工具来创建项目、卡片、便利贴和卡片间的产物引用。画布支持文本、设计、Web 应用、图片、视频与音频卡片；卡片可读取上游材料、编辑设计节点、生成媒体并导出产物。适合希望把多步骤内容制作放在可视化画布上协作的 DSH 用户。安装后，媒体生成需在 DSH 模型配置中提供可用路线及凭证；未配置媒体路线时仍可使用其他画布功能。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:121-180","src/client/index.tsx:54-80","src/host/tools.ts:483-525","src/host/tools.ts:578-790"]}
{"unit_id":"ljcoder2015__dsh-canvas-flow#card-en","repo":"ljcoder2015/dsh-canvas-flow","commit":"096943d4e872c87bac3d46ed1b9e07354393c358","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-canvas-flow is a workflow canvas for DeepSeek Harness. Create projects and text, design, app, image, video, and audio cards, then connect artifacts as references. Agents can reuse upstream content, edit designs, generate media, and export work. Media uses routes configured in DSH settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:121-180","src/client/index.tsx:54-80","src/host/tools.ts:483-525","src/host/tools.ts:578-790"]}
